Reading: the EVEN-sector gap D_eps has a clear MINIMUM near beta~0.26
(finite-L critical region; thermodynamic beta_c~0.2217) and rises on
BOTH sides -> the spectrum is gapped away from the critical point,
gapless at it.  The ODD gap D_sigma -> 0 at large beta is vacuum
tunnelling between the two ordered vacua on the finite torus (SSB),
NOT a physical gapless mode.  Both phases are gapped; the critical
point is the unique gapless fixed point.  This is the exact 0-form
ridge -- an ORDER-PARAMETER criterion (it needs a TRANSITION), not a
single-phase mass-gap criterion.

